### 4. New tests: benchmark_tests/set-priorities.ts
Create `benchmark_tests/` and add a test file in the SAME style as `test/basic.ts`: `import {test} from 'node:test'`, `import assert from 'node:assert/strict'`, `import PQueue, {PriorityQueue} from '../source/index.js'` (tsx resolves `.js` to `.ts`). Tabs, no semicolons, xo-clean.

